<script lang="ts">import { invalidateAll } from '$app/navigation'; import Button from '$lib/components/ui/Button.svelte'; let {data}=$props(); let s=$derived(data.snapshot); let busy=$state(''); async function decide(id:string,action:string){busy=id;await fetch('/api/review',{method:'POST',headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({exceptionId:id,action})});await invalidateAll();busy='';}</script>
<svelte:head><title>Review queue · DriftRecon</title></svelte:head><main class="shell workspace"><p class="eyebrow">Human decides uncertainty</p><h1 class="title">Review queue</h1><p class="lede">Every case includes the agent recommendation and evidence. Approval creates a constrained policy; it never changes imported amounts.</p>{#if !s.exceptions.length}<div class="card empty section">No review cases. Run reconciliation from Overview.</div>{:else}<div class="grid section">{#each s.exceptions as item}<article class="card"><header class="card-head" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><strong>{item.summary}</strong><span class="pill">{item.status}</span></header><div class="card-body"><p>{item.agentRecommendation?.recommendation||'No recommendation available.'}</p><p class="mono" style="font-size:12px;color:#68705f">Confidence {Math.round((item.agentRecommendation?.confidence||item.confidence||0)*100)}%</p><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:20px"><Button disabled={busy===item.id} onclick={()=>decide(item.id,'approve')}>Approve</Button><Button variant="secondary" disabled={busy===item.id} onclick={()=>decide(item.id,'reject')}>Reject</Button><Button variant="ghost" disabled={busy===item.id} onclick={()=>decide(item.id,'unresolved')}>Leave unresolved</Button></div></div></article>{/each}</div>{/if}</main>
